# Pairs with OrphanRecoverable. A root crash also erases the donor's durable marker.
MODULE: CrashDropsDurableMarker
TARGET: OrphanRecoverable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a completed split becomes an unrecoverable orphan after root crash
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ marker' = marker
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: erase durable evidence on crash.
    /\ marker' = FALSE
--- END
